OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHuge waste facility fire shuts
OL,4,ATube and train lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire broke out at a waste
OL,7,Ffacility close to Wembley Stadium in
OL,8,Fnorth-west London, causing disruption
OL,9,Fto Tube and train lines.
OL,11,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said 125
OL,12,Ffirefighters were deployed to tackle
OL,13,Fthe blaze at an industrial estate on
OL,14,FHannah Close in Neasden, with the smoke
OL,15,Fplumes visible from miles away in
OL,16,Fcentral London.
OL,18,FThe LFB was alerted just after 11:30
OL,19,FBST and deployed 20 fire engines to the
OL,20,Fscene. Residents were warned to keep
OL,21,Ftheir windows and doors shut because of
OL,22,Fthe huge amount of smoke.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
