OL,3,GNEWSAHuge waste facility fire shuts
OL,4,ATube and train lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire caused extensive suspensions
OL,7,Facross the Metropolitan line and
OL,8,Fpartial closures on the Jubilee line
OL,9,Fwell into Friday night.
